WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:05.220
on Armistice Day President and mrs. Roosevelt&nbsp;
paid homage at the Tomb of the Unknown Soldier&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:12.360
then the nation mourn some 650,000 dead&nbsp;
in all America's wars in the years ahead&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:20.010
more than half as many again were to die in&nbsp;
their country's service [Music] [Applause]

